    LLM: "Keep high 2s and Aces to regain the lead. Don't waste your only high card on a low-value single.\n\nShape your hand into five-card combinations early. A single 13-card hand is often won by 2 five-card plays and 3 singles.\n\nThe 'Monkey' tactic: Bait opponents into playing their 2 of Spades early so you can dominate the endgame with your Aces.",
